{"seq":3,"slug":"bad-luck-protection","title":"坏运保护：从去重到个性化的运气补偿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/fairness/bad-luck-protection","wordCount":1663,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"坏运保护-从去重到个性化的运气补偿\">坏运保护：从去重到个性化的运气补偿</h1><p>《暗黑破坏神 III》有个玩家心照不宣的现象：你越是缺某件传说，它似乎越不来；可一旦拿到，同款却接二连三地掉。前半句是幸存者偏差，后半句却是真实机制——这就是<strong>坏运保护</strong>（bad-luck protection, BLP）的一个侧面。坏运保护是比 <a href=\"pseudo-random-distribution\">PRD</a> 和<a href=\"pity-timers\">保底</a>更宽的一把伞，涵盖一切「根据玩家历史，主动补偿厄运」的策略。这一篇把这些策略——递增怜悯、去重、智能掉落、个性化补偿——系统地梳理成一个决策框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-坏运保护的谱系\">核心概念：坏运保护的谱系</h2><p>坏运保护的共同内核是<strong>打破独立同分布</strong>：让本次掉落依赖于玩家过去的掉落历史，从而对「运气差的人」倾斜。按干预强度和粒度，可以排成一个谱系：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[坏运保护策略谱系] --&gt; B[概率递增类&lt;br/&gt;PRD·保底·mercy]&#10;  A --&gt; C[去重类&lt;br/&gt;已拥有的降权或移除]&#10;  A --&gt; D[定向类&lt;br/&gt;smart loot 偏向需求]&#10;  A --&gt; E[个性化补偿类&lt;br/&gt;按玩家画像动态调整]&#10;  B --&gt; F[干预:压方差/兜底]&#10;  C --&gt; G[干预:减少重复挫败]&#10;  D --&gt; H[干预:提高有效掉落率]&#10;  E --&gt; I[干预:因人而异的公平]\">flowchart TD\n  A[坏运保护策略谱系] --&gt; B[概率递增类&lt;br/&gt;PRD·保底·mercy]\n  A --&gt; C[去重类&lt;br/&gt;已拥有的降权或移除]\n  A --&gt; D[定向类&lt;br/&gt;smart loot 偏向需求]\n  A --&gt; E[个性化补偿类&lt;br/&gt;按玩家画像动态调整]\n  B --&gt; F[干预:压方差/兜底]\n  C --&gt; G[干预:减少重复挫败]\n  D --&gt; H[干预:提高有效掉落率]\n  E --&gt; I[干预:因人而异的公平]</pre><p>前一篇的保底是「概率递增类」里最硬的一种，本篇把视野扩到另外三类——它们常与保底叠加使用，共同构成一套完整的运气治理方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"概率递增类-怜悯值-mercy\">概率递增类：怜悯值 (mercy)</h2><p>这一类是 PRD/保底的推广。除了前两篇讲的线性递增和分段陡增，还有一种「怜悯计数器」（mercy counter）常见于 CS:GO 开箱、Apex 等：设置一个「保证间隔」，比如「每开 X 个箱子必出一个稀有」，用计数器跟踪，到阈值强制触发并归零。</p>\n<p>它和保底的区别在于<strong>语义</strong>：保底针对「某个特定目标物」（抽到这个角色），怜悯值针对「某个稀有度层」（出一件紫色以上，不管具体是啥）。怜悯值本质是<a href=\"../sampling/rarity-tiers\">稀有度层级</a>里讲的「保底配额」的实现。数学上，若基础层掉率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、怜悯上限为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>，则实际期望间隔为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>间隔</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{间隔}] = \\sum_{n=1}^{M-1} n \\cdot p(1-p)^{n-1} + M(1-p)^{M-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">间隔</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1413em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即「在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 之前按几何分布触发，否则第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 次强制触发」的加权和——比纯几何分布的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 略小，且方差大幅收窄。</p>\n<h2 id=\"去重与智能掉落\">去重与智能掉落</h2><p><strong>去重</strong>（duplicate protection）解决的是另一种挫败：不是「刷不出好东西」，而是「刷出的全是重复的、我早有了的」。实现方式有几种强度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>去重强度</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>代表游戏</th>\n<th>副作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬去重</td>\n<td>已拥有的从池中移除</td>\n<td>卡牌收集类</td>\n<td>收集完后池子空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软去重</td>\n<td>已拥有的权重降低</td>\n<td>多数 ARPG</td>\n<td>仍可能重复但概率低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复转化</td>\n<td>重复自动转成货币/碎片</td>\n<td>抽卡游戏</td>\n<td>需设计转化经济</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>软去重是最常用的折中：给玩家已拥有的物品乘一个小于 1 的权重系数（如 0.1），既大幅降低重复、又不至于「收集完就再也不掉」。这正是<a href=\"../foundations/loot-model\">掉落模型</a>里 <code>not_owned</code> 条件的加权版本。</p>\n<p><strong>智能掉落</strong>（smart loot）更进一步，主动偏向玩家<strong>需要</strong>的东西。《暗黑破坏神 III》的传说掉落有较高概率是当前职业能用的，做法是在抽样时给「匹配当前职业/当前 build」的物品加权。智能掉落显著提高了「有效掉落率」（玩家真正能用上的掉落占比），但也削弱了交易与惊喜——你几乎不会掉出别的职业的极品拿去换东西了。这个取舍的经济后果，要放到<a href=\"../practice/loot-economy\">掉落与经济平衡</a>去权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"个性化补偿-贝叶斯视角\">个性化补偿：贝叶斯视角</h2><p>最前沿的坏运保护是<strong>个性化</strong>：不对所有玩家用同一套规则，而是根据每个玩家的实际掉落历史动态调整。可以用贝叶斯的框架理解：把「玩家感知到的掉率」看成一个后验，系统持续估计「这个玩家是不是运气显著偏差」，若某玩家的实际掉落数远低于期望（落在分布的极端尾部），就悄悄给他提高掉率。</p>\n<p>一个简单的实现是跟踪玩家的「运气偏差分数」：设玩家已尝试 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次、实得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次目标，期望应得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">np</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 次，偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = \\frac{k - np}{\\sqrt{np(1-p)}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7618em;vertical-align:-0.8296em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4642em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord sqrt mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0369em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.4286em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.4286em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"padding-left:1.19em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0089em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.4286em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail mtight\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.5429em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.5429em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4197em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8296em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 显著为负（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z &lt; -2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>，即比期望差两个标准差），就临时上调掉率把他拉回。这种「隐形补偿」的好处是不破坏大多数玩家的正常体验，只救真正的极端非酋；难点是<strong>必须隐蔽</strong>——一旦玩家发现「装死能提高掉率」就会被利用，也一旦被发现「运气好反而被降率」会引发信任危机。</p>\n<p>个性化补偿高度依赖玩家行为数据，因此它和<a href=\"../../game-telemetry-analytics/applied/player-segmentation-ml\">遥测与分析 hub</a> 的玩家画像技术紧密相关；具体上调多少、何时上调，则要靠<a href=\"../practice/drop-tuning\">掉落率调校</a>里的数据驱动方法去校准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反噬与伦理边界\">反噬与伦理边界</h2><p>坏运保护并非越多越好，过度会带来反噬：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可预测性侵蚀惊喜</strong>：若玩家能算准「第 90 抽必出」，随机的多巴胺魔力就被抽干了，掉落沦为纯粹的进度条。好的设计要在「有兜底」和「仍有惊喜」间留白。</li>\n<li><strong>可利用性</strong>：任何依赖历史的机制都可能被逆向和利用（攒失败、装死、卡计数器），必须做好隐藏与反作弊。</li>\n<li><strong>透明度悖论</strong>：保底类机制玩家希望透明（好规划），个性化补偿类却必须隐蔽（防利用）——两者的透明度要求相反，混用时要想清楚哪部分公开、哪部分保密。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些边界的把握，本质上是在「统计公平」和「感知公平」之间做工程权衡——正是<a href=\"../foundations/random-vs-deterministic\">随机与确定性奖励</a>提出、而整个<a href=\"./\">公平</a>章试图回答的核心命题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>坏运保护是「打破独立同分布、按玩家历史补偿厄运」的一把大伞，含概率递增、去重、智能掉落、个性化补偿四类。</li>\n<li>怜悯值针对「稀有度层」（保底配额），去重针对「重复挫败」（软去重最常用），智能掉落主动偏向玩家需求以提高有效掉落率。</li>\n<li>个性化补偿用贝叶斯/偏差分数只救极端非酋，好处是不扰动大多数人，但必须隐蔽以防利用。</li>\n<li>坏运保护有反噬：过度会侵蚀惊喜、被利用、并陷入透明度悖论（保底要透明、补偿要隐蔽）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"pity-timers\">保底机制</a> —— 概率递增类里最硬的一种。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../sampling/rarity-tiers\">稀有度层级</a> —— 怜悯值即保底配额的实现。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../practice/drop-tuning\">掉落率调校</a> —— 如何校准补偿的触发与幅度。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-telemetry-analytics/applied/player-segmentation-ml\">遥测与分析 · 玩家分群与 ML</a> —— 个性化补偿依赖的玩家画像。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"坏运保护：从去重到个性化的运气补偿","id":"坏运保护-从去重到个性化的运气补偿"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：坏运保护的谱系","id":"核心概念-坏运保护的谱系"},{"level":2,"text":"概率递增类：怜悯值 (mercy)","id":"概率递增类-怜悯值-mercy"},{"level":2,"text":"去重与智能掉落","id":"去重与智能掉落"},{"level":2,"text":"个性化补偿：贝叶斯视角","id":"个性化补偿-贝叶斯视角"},{"level":2,"text":"反噬与伦理边界","id":"反噬与伦理边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"保底机制：给最坏运气一个明确上限","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/fairness/pity-timers"},"next":{"title":"掉落与经济平衡：作为水龙头的战利品","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/practice/loot-economy"}}